---
description: Accessible, responsive UI for contributor-conclave
globs: src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# UI

- Semantic HTML (`button`, `nav`, `main`, headings in order).
- Every input has a visible `<label>` or an equivalent accessible name.
- Interactive elements are reachable and usable by keyboard.
- Focus styles stay visible. Do not remove outlines without a replacement.
- Layouts work on narrow and wide viewports.
- Style with the existing Tailwind v4 setup (`globals.css`). Do not add another CSS framework.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<label htmlFor="repo">Repository</label>
<input id="repo" name="repo" className="focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2" />
```
